        <mxCell id="ak8_U5sInBHRbDaeF3ad-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Gamble hitter sim&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Simple sim that simulates gambler picto effectiness ins expedition 33. In short the picto has 50% chance for every hit do either 50% damage or 200% damage. Program will simulate effectiveness of this when run multiple times. Program will be very simple prototype that assumes every hit player makes has same damage value. For now program will be run only once and with pre determined constant variables, if needed in future program might be modified to take user input and allow running multiple times before terminating.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="10" width="770" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
